From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1381/3799] soh: rename D_80B01678 -> sCylinderInit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the ColliderCylinderInitType1 passed to Collider_SetCylinderType1 in Init.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
index 0f0bf2998..d66a5c727 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
@@ -181,7 +181,8 @@ const ActorInit En_Skj_InitVars = {
     NULL,
 };
 
-static ColliderCylinderInitType1 D_80B01678 = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80B01678: the ColliderCylinderInitType1 passed to Collider_SetCylinderType1 in Init.
+static ColliderCylinderInitType1 sCylinderInit = {  // was D_80B01678 [LLM:HIGH]
     {
         COLTYPE_NONE,
         AT_ON | AT_TYPE_ENEMY,
@@ -444,7 +445,7 @@ void EnSkj_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play2) {
             this->actor.colChkInfo.damageTable = &sDamageTable;
             this->actor.colChkInfo.health = 10;
             Collider_InitCylinder(play, &this->collider);
-            Collider_SetCylinderType1(play, &this->collider, &this->actor, &D_80B01678);
+            Collider_SetCylinderType1(play, &this->collider, &this->actor, &sCylinderInit);  // was D_80B01678 [LLM:HIGH]
             ActorShape_Init(&this->actor.shape, 0.0f, ActorShadow_DrawCircle, 40.0f);
             Actor_SetScale(thisx, 0.01f);
             this->actor.textId = this->textId = 0;
